Vinh Khanh Street is a top spot for seafood in District 4.
Restaurants like Ốc Oanh (534 Vinh Khanh) and Quán Ốc Sáu Nở (128 Vinh Khanh) are located on Vinh Khanh Street.
Restaurants on Vinh Khanh Street serve oysters, grilled shrimp, crab, and snails with dipping sauces.
